<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>!</p>

<p>Someone has requested a link to change your <strong>DPLA Analytics Dashboard</strong> password.
You can change your password by clicking the link below.</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Change my password', edit_user_password_url(reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>Or copy this URL into your browser:<br>
<%= edit_user_password_url(reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. Your password won't
change until you access the link above and create a new one.</p>

